# naming.rules — files, classes, members, state, data, routes, tests
# SOP: sop/naming-conventions.md
# Guardrails: guardrails/architecture.md (STRUCT-1)

## Files and directories
MUST      NAME-1  snake_case for every new directory and file; file stem = primary class in snake_case (product_list_cubit.dart -> ProductListCubit).
MUST      NAME-2  Generated suffixes: x.g.dart, x.freezed.dart, <router>.gr.dart (per codegen in use). Test files: <source>_test.dart mirroring the lib path.
MUST      NAME-3  Widgets folder is `widgets/` (never `widget/`).
MUST-NOT  NAME-4  Create camelCase directories or files (chatDetailsScreen/, completeProfile_request_model_entity.dart are LEGACY).

## Types and members
MUST      NAME-5  UpperCamelCase for classes/enums/typedefs/extensions/mixins; lowerCamelCase for members, parameters, constants (no SCREAMING_CAPS) and enum values.
MUST      NAME-6  Private injected dependencies: `final XRepository _repository;`.
MUST      NAME-7  Booleans read as predicates: isLoading, hasMore, canProceed, shouldRetry.
MUST      NAME-8  Async methods are verbs without an Async suffix (fetchProducts, not fetchProductsAsync). Callbacks: onX (onInternetRestored).
SHOULD    NAME-9  Constants holders as plural nouns for new classes (AppStrings, AppConstants); existing singular holders are LEGACY — keep, do not rename in feature PRs.

## Role suffixes
MUST      NAME-10 XRepository (abstract, domain) / XRepositoryImpl (data); XRemoteDataSource / XLocalDataSource; XService (interface) / XServiceImpl; BaseX for inheritance helpers; XMixin for mixins; XGuard; XInterceptor; XMapper.
MUST-NOT  NAME-11 Prefix an interface with Base (Base means inheritance helper, not contract). Existing Base* interfaces are LEGACY naming — keep, do not copy.

## Presentation
MUST      NAME-12 Routed screens: XScreen -> generated XRoute. Tab bodies: XTabScreen. Sheets: XSheet + showXSheet(). Dialogs: showXDialog().
MUST      NAME-13 UI models: XUiModel (or XViewData) in ui/<feature>/models/.
SHOULD    NAME-14 New widgets use descriptive nouns (AppButton, PrimaryButton, UserAvatar); no My/Custom prefixes.

## State management
MUST      NAME-15 XCubit / XBloc / XState / XEvent share one stem; state is named after the owner, never after a field (LastMessageState is LEGACY).
MUST      NAME-16 Event base: `sealed class XEvent extends Equatable`. Subclasses are facts or requests — LoginRequested, OtpSubmitted, ChatPinned, PinnedMessagesRequested. No `On` prefix, no `Event` suffix on subclasses.
MUST      NAME-17 Use the shared state model selected by the project (enum or sealed types). Do not invent a base_status.dart class or duplicate the same status contract per feature.
MUST      NAME-18 Cubit folder = snake_case stem: product_list_cubit/ (existing productListCubit/ is LEGACY).

## Data
MUST      NAME-19 Response models: XEntity. Request models: XReqModel. Never Model*Response*Entity, *ModelEntity, or *ResponseModelEntity.
MUST      NAME-20 Local DB models: XLocalModel (+ XLocalModelAdapter / table class per persistence ADR); follow the existing convention if the project already has one.
MUST      NAME-21 Endpoint constants: lowerCamelCase verb-noun, no `API` suffix, no duplicates (fetchProductList, aboutUs). Existing *API names are LEGACY; reuse, do not add new duplicates.
MUST      NAME-22 Storage keys: StorageKeys.x; config fields mirror JSON keys in lowerCamelCase (BASE_URL -> baseUrl).

## Realtime
MUST      NAME-23 Bus events: <Noun><PastTenseVerb>Event (NewProductAddedEvent, LogoutEvent) in core/realtime/events/<domain>_realtime_event.dart.

## Tests
MUST      NAME-24 group('<ClassName>') > group('<method>') > test('<behaviour>'); mocks `MockXRepository`; fixtures test/fixtures/<endpoint>_response.json.

## Project
PROJECT   See docs/project/flutter/project-rules.md for overrides and open decisions.
MUST-NOT  Invent class/file names from profiles/reference/ or example ADRs when docs/project/flutter/ still has _TBD_ stubs.
